	<row id="msg_0478_T05R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Fuji live here, but he out right\nnow.\rHe at the House of Memories. He always\nthere. He’s hella... devoted.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0478_T05R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Can you BELIEVE it?\rSome people get bored of takin’ care\nof homies and just DUMP ’em.\rGrandpa take in poor homeless homies\nand raise ’em. We got 40 now. In a\fstudio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0478_T05R0201_00002" index="2">
